  m_text: the player can click the "Gamble" button after a win to activate the risk
    game. in the Game The player faces off against the dealer with a total of four
    cards. The player selects one of three face-down cards first, then the dealer
    reveals their card. If the player's chosen card is higher in value than the dealer's
    card, the player's winnings are doubled. If not, the player receives nothing.
